{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-50","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：二项无理线段与线段","englishTitle":"To find the third binomial straight line.","book":10,"number":50,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":50,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","contentId":"euclid-10-50","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4bb84b4a6e7f22d17121df5fc1c50b8bb6c0824617f23f1889a1cf027c58f73c","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-50.statement","euclid-10-50.construction.1","euclid-10-50.construction.2","euclid-10-50.construction.3","euclid-10-50.proof.1","euclid-10-50.proof.2","euclid-10-50.proof.3","euclid-10-50.proof.4","euclid-10-50.proof.5","euclid-10-50.proof.6","euclid-10-50.proof.7","euclid-10-50.proof.8","euclid-10-50.proof.9","euclid-10-50.proof.10","euclid-10-50.construction.4","euclid-10-50.proof.11","euclid-10-50.proof.12","euclid-10-50.proof.13","euclid-10-50.conclusion","euclid-10-50.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-50.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7625554934478bae13fa7b1d168cb75e583e1a9c8e44f1c6a4fcc60c1a16e1b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the third binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到第三条二项无理线段直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b273d4eba0603277de35b2af42a77a3112130cdb14c1616f7f119d46eb09d8e1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two numbers AC, CB be set out such that the sum of them AB has to BC the ratio which a square number has to a square number, but has not to AC the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出两个数字AC,CB,AB和BC,即平方数和平方数的比,但没有达到AC,即平方数和平方数的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b322f8be35273761cb707cfd6f06601e7ec0c98a2c0d4fbf1fa3e8250dbbfaaf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let any other number D, not square, be set out also, and let it not have to either of the numbers BA. AC the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"也列出其他数字D,而不是正方形, 并且不要把数字BA, AC比平方数比平方数比平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6291cbb283ada5fa506e5b003af97598b42b38086d2479dbf6c12b3e12d8b168","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let any rational straight line E be set out, and let it be contrived that, as D is to AB, so is the square on E to the square on FG; [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore the square on E is commensurable with the square on FG. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何有理线段 E数字都行,并假设D和AB数字之比等于E和FG的正方形个数字之比;因此,E和正方形个数字为可公度个和FG数字为正方形个数字 [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4262e618ae984e2db7402e5dd5b7e6c97db73a8e2e235c4bc92706ea070be3e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And E is rational; therefore FG is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E是有理,FG也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"272b47e10e300fd07eea28405dcde19f8a46778473ca1459dcfe2e38532f0b32","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since D has not to AB the ratio which a square number has to a square number, neither has the square on E to the square on FG the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore E is incommensurable in length with FG. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于D的比例没有达到AB的比例,平方数的比例为平方数的比例为平方数的比例,E的比例为正方形的比例为正方形的比例为正方形的比例,FG的比例为平方数的比例为平方数的比例；上述对应量不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7c219753ec80ca70870f7a58ec3eb7615aa527f86980e5464177c826ad019dc0","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next let it be contrived that, as the number BA is to AC, so is the square on FG to the square on GH; [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore the square on FG is commensurable with the square on GH. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,我们假设,BA对AC的比等于FG对GH对正方形的比;因此,FG对正方形的比是可公度对GH的比是正方形。 [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2da72e7823dc4e81058d8c8a401ff0c942c325599a03e0b79e19d7b4901176c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But FG is rational; therefore GH is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FG是有理,因此GH也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c5b93982290eb93f46583659440d56f66149b965c7bd640b108b873a93bd9b15","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BA has not to AC the ratio which a square number has to a square number, neither has the square on FG to the square on HG the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore FG is incommensurable in length with GH. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于BA的比例没有达到AC的比例,平方数的比例为平方数的比例为平方数的比例,FG的比例为正方形的比例为正方形的比例为正方形的比例,HG的比例为平方数的比例为平方数的比例。（相关点与线段：GH）；上述对应量不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ff1753ab59a419a5fb159ceae034c12bd5a5d273743b326bd8a53a952f8e3a9","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FG, GH are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore FH is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FG,GH是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;FH是二项无理线段。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61a30d738c3768c82770b07f7719bc1f315276797e14a30f24eea9146c6bc220","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a third binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第3条二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"86ffc4fe61feba1da168434d93f898f4f39ef520aaf47a397ea172d241dde94b","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as D is to AB, so is the square on E to the square on FG, and, as BA is to AC, so is the square on FG to the square on GH, therefore, ex aequali, as D is to AC, so is the square on E to the square on GH. [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D比AB,这等于E比正方形,FG比正方形,BA比AC,因此,FG比正方形比正方形,GH比正方形,因此,在平等的基础上,D比AC等于E比正方形比正方形 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88d04e93d6ab020ee524af531b56d38e6fd73191a076a21d1a9eadd731487c57","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But D has not to AC the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore neither has the square on E to the square on GH the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore E is incommensurable in length with GH. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数;因此,GH的比例为正方形,而E的比例为正方形,而GH的比例为平方数;因此,E的比例为不可公度,而GH的比例为不可公度。（相关点与线段：AC） [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1b2b56e3a81f07ddac96adaf58b18c8de4f19e66f6670bad1739bd0eac60732","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as BA is to AC, so is the square on FG to the square on GH, therefore the square on FG is greater than the square on GH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA比AC等于FG比正方形,GH比正方形,FG比正方形,FG比正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":14,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"789fa33c76f943843ad8f8ea0a3429f16b93eacf6fe781b5bf46347e9a37034c","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then the squares on GH, K be equal to the square on FG; therefore, convertendo, as AB is to BC, so is the square on FG to the square on K. [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GH,K,正方形等于FG,正方形;因此,转换率为AB-BC,相当于FG,正方形与K,正方形；上述对应量具有相同的比例关系。 [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee463999d844800c43d06eaddd71d5e0167f5099930364afd8128611f1da449c","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB has to BC the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore the square on FG also has to the square on K the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore FG is commensurable in length with K. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AB的比例为BC,而平方数的比例为平方数;因此,FG的比例为正方形,K的比例为正方形,平方数的比例为平方数,BC的比例为平方数;因此,FG的比例为长度可公度,K。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84456a05960961f7a113aab499621bd785e03abea0a23ac0eaa8cb85e2e81995","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on FG is greater than the square on GH by the square on a straight line commensurable with FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FG线上的正方形比GH线上的正方形大于正方形,而可公度上为FG线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1cbc5e0f973b90bca7eac0069085004308e9799620c74c7fd5c2a93464b0379","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And FG, GH are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, and neither of them is commensurable in length with E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG,GH是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度, 两者中无一是长度可公度和E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":18,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"94252a4b53c6cfc14eecef7580280267823b24cad1a91f5a6ddec0d76966c4e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FH is a third binomial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FH是第三条二项无理线段直线,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-50.source","contentId":"euclid-10-50","revisionId":"euclid-10-50@raw-4bb84b4a6e7f22d1","order":19,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ca48ef1c4a0cbcbbb3ae5ad89bc317704b3b63184e160f4f5f6cc3d5edc469e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-50:euclid-10-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-50","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-50.construction.3","euclid-10-50.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50/","sourceLabel":"X. 6, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-50:euclid-10-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-50","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-50.proof.2","euclid-10-50.proof.5","euclid-10-50.proof.9","euclid-10-50.proof.11"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50/","sourceLabel":"X. 9"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-50:euclid-10-36:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-50","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-50.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-36","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50/","sourceLabel":"X. 36"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-50:euclid-5-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-50","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-50.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50/","sourceLabel":"V. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-50:euclid-5-19:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-50","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-50.construction.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-19","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.50/","sourceLabel":"V. 19, Por."}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-50:euclid-10-6:explicit","id":"euclid-10-6","book":10,"number":6,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与比例与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-50:euclid-10-9:explicit","id":"euclid-10-9","book":10,"number":9,"kind":"proposition","title":"长度可公度与平方数比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-50:euclid-10-36:explicit","id":"euclid-10-36","book":10,"number":36,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与二项无理线段与无理线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-50:euclid-5-22:explicit","id":"euclid-5-22","book":5,"number":22,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-50:euclid-5-19:explicit","id":"euclid-5-19","book":5,"number":19,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例论","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-irrational","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
